<view class="chapter-background-page">
  <image
    class="chapter-background-image"
    src="/assets/GPT_s1v1_back.png"
    mode="scaleToFill"
  />

  <view class="chapter-background-copy">
    <text class="chapter-background-chapter">第一章·产品创意总监孙权·便签疑云</text>
    <text class="chapter-background-heading">调查背景</text>

    <view class="chapter-background-story">
      <text class="chapter-background-paragraph">孙权入职半年，交出来的产品全和鸭子有关：神探夏洛鸭、线条小鸭、鸭布布、送你一朵小红鸭……朱元璋忍无可忍：“三天内交出十二生肖云锦设计图，否则滚蛋！”</text>
      <text class="chapter-background-paragraph">第三天，孙权如期上交朱元璋全套十二生肖，线稿配色注释齐全。</text>
      <text class="chapter-background-paragraph">但就在交稿次日，李唐文化传媒竟于自家门户发布了完全相同的设计，一字不差。</text>
      <text class="chapter-background-paragraph">难道是孙权故意泄露商业机密？他为什么要这么做？</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view
    class="chapter-background-back-button"
    bindtap="goBack"
    hover-class="chapter-background-back-button--pressed"
    hover-stay-time="80"
    aria-role="button"
    aria-label="返回嫌疑人列表"
  ></view>

  <view
    class="chapter-background-start-button"
    bindtap="startInvestigation"
    hover-class="chapter-background-start-button--pressed"
    hover-stay-time="80"
    aria-role="button"
    aria-label="开始调查"
  >
    <image
      class="chapter-background-start-button-image"
      src="/assets/GPT_s1v1_button.png"
      mode="widthFix"
    />
  </view>
</view>
